---
const commands = [
  "npm run notion:sync",
  "npm run build",
];
---

<section class="content-hero notion-hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">Default Writing System</span>
  <h1>Notion as the publishing cockpit</h1>
  <p>Write in Notion, mark what is public, and let the build pull clean Markdown into Astro. The API key stays in the build environment and never ships to the browser.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="button-primary" href="/notes">Read notes</a>
    <a class="button-secondary" href="/search">Search site</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="notion-flow" aria-label="Notion publishing workflow">
  <article>
    <span>01</span>
    <h2>Create an internal integration</h2>
    <p>在 Notion 开发者面板创建 internal integration，复制 API secret，并确保它有 read content 权限。</p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <span>02</span>
    <h2>Share your databases</h2>
    <p>把 Notes 和 Papers 数据库通过 Add connections 分享给这个 integration。没有分享时，Notion API 会返回 404。</p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <span>03</span>
    <h2>Set environment variables</h2>
    <p>在本地或 Cloudflare Pages 里设置 Notion secret 和 data source ID。也可以填 database ID，脚本会自动读取第一个 data source。</p>
  </article>
  <article>
    <span>04</span>
    <h2>Build static pages</h2>
    <p>构建时同步公开内容，生成 Notes、Research、RSS、Search 和 Tags。草稿默认不会发布。</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="notion-schema">
  <div class="section-head compact-head">
    <h2>Database Shape</h2>
    <p>字段名不需要完全固定，脚本会识别常见英文和中文命名。最少只需要一个标题字段；其余字段用于更好的摘要、标签、日期和发布控制。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="schema-grid">
    <article>
      <span>Notes</span>
      <h3>建议字段</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Name / Title: title</li>
        <li>Description / Summary: text</li>
        <li>Date / Published: date</li>
        <li>Tags: multi-select</li>
        <li>Status: status or select</li>
        <li>Draft: checkbox</li>
        <li>Slug: text, optional</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>Papers</span>
      <h3>建议字段</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Name / Title: title</li>
        <li>Authors: text or multi-select</li>
        <li>Status: under review / preprint / published / in preparation</li>
        <li>Year, Venue, Abstract</li>
        <li>PDF and Code links</li>
        <li>Tags: multi-select</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article>
      <span>Commands</span>
      <h3>同步命令</h3>
      <ul>
        {commands.map((command) => <li><code>{command}</code></li>)}
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="notion-env">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Environment</span>
    <h2>Paste this into <code>.env.local</code></h2>
    <p>线上部署时，把同样的变量加到 Cloudflare Pages 的 Environment variables。不要把真实 secret 提交进 Git。</p>
  </div>
  <pre><code>NOTION_API_KEY=secret_xxx
NOTION_NOTES_DATA_SOURCE_ID=your_notes_data_source_id
NOTION_PAPERS_DATA_SOURCE_ID=your_papers_data_source_id
NOTION_SYNC_DRAFTS=false
NOTION_CLEAN_SYNC=true</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="notion-alt">
  <a href="/obsidian">
    <span>Local fallback</span>
    <strong>Prefer a private local vault?</strong>
    <p>Obsidian 同步仍然保留，但现在默认发布流已经切到 Notion。</p>
  </a>
</section>
